/P 45 0 R
/E (Everything & Then Some, Ltd. is a diversified wholesale company supplying businesses and specialist retailers across a broad portfolio of products, including tools and hardware, lighting, automotive care, household goods and other specialist product lines. Its customers show very different purchasing patterns, making repeat-purchase behaviour difficult to anticipate. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
61 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 45 0 R
/E (The company wants to use its historical sales data to support more targeted commercial actions. Your team has been asked to develop a deployment-ready solution capable of answering two questions: will this customer make another purchase within the next 90 days after the current transaction, and how much will they spend in that period? )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
62 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 45 0 R
/E (Together, the two answers let the commercial team act on each customer: those unlikely to return can be targeted with incentives to bring them back, while those expected to spend the most can be prioritized for retention and dedicated account management. Your tool should therefore work for any new purchase, giving the team both predictions at the moment it matters.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
